@startuml Timeline
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

participant "Publisher" as Pub
participant "Broker(Storage)" as Store
participant "Consumer" as Cons
participant "Background" as BG

== Публикация ==
Pub -> Store: TryStoreAsync(message)
activate Store
Store -> Store: Write to messages.jsonl\n(State=Pending)
Store --> Pub: true
deactivate Store

== Доставка консьюмеру ==
Cons -> Store: FetchAsync(queue, consumerId, visibilityTimeout)
activate Store
Store -> Store: Find Pending message\nMark as InFlight\nSet VisibleUntil
Store --> Cons: List<Message>
deactivate Store

note right of Cons: Обрабатывает сообщение...

== Успешная обработка ==
Cons -> Store: TryAcknowledgeAsync(messageId, success=true)
activate Store
Store -> Store: Mark as Acknowledged\nRemove from file
Store --> Cons: acknowledged=true
deactivate Store

== Альтернатива: Ошибка с повтором ==
Cons -> Store: TryRejectAsync(messageId, requeue=true)
activate Store
Store -> Store: DeliveryCount < MaxAttempts?
alt Да
    Store -> Store: State=Pending
    Store --> Cons: rejected=true, moved_to_dlq=false
else Нет
    Store -> Store: State=DeadLetter\nMove to DLQ
    Store --> Cons: rejected=true, moved_to_dlq=true
end
deactivate Store

== Фоновая очистка ==
BG -> Store: ExpireMessagesAsync()
activate Store
Store -> Store: Remove where ExpiresAt <= now\nReturn InFlight with expired timeout
Store --> BG: count of expired
deactivate Store

@enduml